OL,3,AUK soldiers could get paragliders to
OL,4,Adrop behind enemy lines
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish soldiers could soon be given
OL,7,Fpowered paragliders to enable them to
OL,8,Ffly up to 200 miles behind enemy lines.
OL,10,FThe backpack-sized gliders mean Royal
OL,11,FMarine and Parachute Regiment troops
OL,12,Fcould fly into hostile areas during the
OL,13,Fnight without the need to drop from
OL,14,Faircraft.
OL,16,FManufacturer Blakcro, which is based in
OL,17,FWiltshire, say the machines can be
OL,18,Fassembled in eight minutes and launched
OL,19,Fon foot.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
